  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/z4mbo/Origin/zipball/origin-v0.2.15",
  "body": "# Origin 0.2.15: Clearer provider usage\n\n2026-10-19\n\n## Quota checks respect model access\n\nUsage distinguishes unavailable subscription allowances from model sign-in. API-key, managed and separately authenticated connections no longer read another account's personal subscription quota. API-key activity remains available in History.\n\n## Grok billing fallback\n\nUsage keeps a valid Grok billing allowance when its separate credits endpoint refuses access. Unreported windows stay unknown.\n\nDesktop source: [origin-v0.2.15](https://github.com/z4mbo/Origin/tree/origin-v0.2.15) (`cf9e6fdec944700aa1ee395d05512afbaf95da97`). [Native build and packaged smoke checks](https://github.com/z4mbo/Origin/actions/runs/39318738462) completed successfully for Windows x64, Mac Apple Silicon and Mac Intel.\n\nWindows packages are unsigned. Mac packages are ad hoc signed and are not notarized; Mac updates require a fresh manual download. If macOS blocks an app you choose to trust, use **System Settings → Privacy & Security → Open Anyway**, following [Apple's opening instructions](https://support.apple.com/en-us/102445). These build checks do not establish interactive installation or signed-updater acceptance.\n\nThe Windows portable archive is `Origin-0.2.15-windows-x64.zip`; `Origin-0.2.15-x64.zip` is the Mac Intel update archive. `SHA256SUMS-0.2.15.txt` covers all 13 installers, archives, blockmaps and updater feeds. The release manifest records the exact source, native run, sizes and hashes.\n\nSee the [audit report](https://github.com/z4mbo/Origin/blob/cf9e6fdec944700aa1ee395d05512afbaf95da97/docs/verification/origin-audit.md) and [review PR](https://github.com/z4mbo/Origin/pull/1) for verification and remaining limits.\n"
